  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back at Bianca International, an English encyclopedia sales office in Sapporo, the section chief calls Muranishi over to his desk. Muranishi has sold nothing all month, yet somehow stays cheerful. Listen to the boss's frustration and Muranishi's polite excuses.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "村西、ちょっと。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "はい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "また契約ゼロか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "不景気の影響ですかね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "違うよ。お前の問題だろ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "来月から来なくていい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それは困りますよ。家族がいるんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "ほんと不思議なやつだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ありがとうございます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "褒めてないよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "前向きに生きろと父から教わったので。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "小野から学んで結果を出せ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Watch how Muranishi stays polite with 'masu' and 'desu' while his boss speaks down to him in plain, clipped endings.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "村西、ちょっと。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Muranishi, a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "また契約ゼロか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Zero contracts again?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "不景気の影響ですかね。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Maybe it is the effect of the recession.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "違うよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wrong.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "来月から来なくていい。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You do not need to come in starting next month.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "それは困りますよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That puts me in a bind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "家族がいるんで。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have a family.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "ほんと不思議なやつだな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You really are a strange guy.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "褒めてないよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not praising you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "前向きに生きろと父から教わったので。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My father taught me to live positively.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kacho",
      "t": "小野から学んで結果を出せ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Learn from Ono and get results.'",
